chaosircd (2.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging (debian/control, rules, changelog).
  * Build with cmake + debhelper-compat 13, installing to FHS-correct
    locations (/etc/chaosircd, /var/lib/chaosircd, /var/log/chaosircd,
    /usr/libexec, /etc/sv/chaosircd for the runit service) via the newly
    overridable inidir/logdir/sysconfdir/runitservicedir cmake cache
    variables.
  * Pin -std=gnu17 so the build doesn't break on toolchains that default
    to C23 (where true/false/bool are keywords, colliding with this
    codebase's own bool typedef).

 -- Roman Senn <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 19:47:57 +0200
